{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":20,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":20,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":344,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/avatar.png","skin":"露营","skin_cn":""},{"id":510,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/%E7%9D%A1%E8%A1%A3/chihiro.png","skin":"睡衣","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"各务","given_name":"千寻","family_name_jp":"各務","given_name_jp":"チヒロ","family_name_kr":"카가미","given_name_kr":"치히로","family_name_en":"Kagami","given_name_en":"Chihiro","family_name_zh_tw":"各務","given_name_zh_tw":"千尋","family_name_cn":"各务","given_name_cn":"千寻","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"安全检查要从日常做起","main_relation":36,"relation":[39],"age":17,"grade":"三年生","height":160,"birthday":"04-26","hobby":"选购电子产品","designer":"ni02","illustrator":"ni02","character_voice":"山村响","character_voice_cn":"烤梨","release_date":"2022-01-30","release_date_cn":"2024-02-13","release_date_global":"2022-09-10","school":4,"weapon_type":"AR","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Large","special_appearance":false,"spine":[421,152,720],"model":[57,263],"voice":[{"description":"CH0160_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/ICj2NwnEoQ7aFqGATqRkDOHxI4jEuuRe.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这……看来又是我们真理社的孩子捅出的篓子。","text_original":"何だか、またうちの子たちがやらかしたらしいね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/DHraFiMijRcAmOAraK6hhefenC7dRPkI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"嗯……嗯，熬了一夜，确实有点累了。","text_original":"んっ……流石に、徹夜をすると少し疲れる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/1mS3zW52AWZkrIgwK3pIuclPl2rMjBeG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"咦……难道，服务器又崩溃了……？","text_original":"あれ……もしかしてこれ、またサーバーが爆発した……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/le4h4snsIvXRSFVgEnUD2BqI2V4zP7jD.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"（这家咖啡厅不卖咖啡吗？）","text_original":"（ここ、コーヒーとか売ってないのかな）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/MdSMU0sUuoTpOvEvT8YqGpAKMQgsfiRo.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（这种程度的安保防护……10秒就足够了。）","text_original":"（このセキュリティレベルだと……まあ10秒あれば十分かな）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/Fb5tLBpYraqKMiY8MAZuR1YTkH8lnWpG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"我会修复安全漏洞的。","text_original":"セキュリティ上の弱点、修復するね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/k3QnkwyCIysSmnKCp3oR7qhhc0KXwtLj.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"其实我不太喜欢这种破解方法。","text_original":"こういうクラッキングは好みじゃないけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/1YZhCTAjNqPh5AkMM69ATIv32dATEBkI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"不过为了可爱的后辈们，没办法了。","text_original":"かわいい後輩たちのためなら仕方ない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/f5VyJiTDrxRdv46AaNdvKUoJxQ7ngToR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"哼，下不为例啊。","text_original":"はぁ…こういうのは今回だけだよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/1sXuMSD3g9xw9g6EEDdbJxDlmwjTkKN9.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"你最好提高一下安全意识。","text_original":"もう少しセキュリティ意識を持った方がいい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/PZHoEH22XAXpLiyQoj4s2RCgubX7UPJY.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"嗯，我全都看见了。","text_original":"うん…全部見えた。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/sOa5IAW0Y55xVPGeO0LpGDBwkkPOUeH5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"砰！","text_original":"BOOM！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/dLS0Rasg4Ko4Yhag4jonaYZe81xK7tYV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"枪械对白帽黑客来说也是必不可少的。比如说，嗯……用来对付蛮不讲理的客户……","text_original":"ホワイトハッカーにとっても、銃は必需品。例えば、そうだね……失礼なクライアントがいた時とか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/2swdsW8ItNCLOYCUkSFZVn2z3JFcMXey.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"嗯？是发现新的安全漏洞了吗？","text_original":"うん？新しいセキュリティホールにも見つかった","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/j2OSvsZSpmCcsUOW1KQo2lHj2THblr5k.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"知道了，我马上到。","text_original":"了解。すぐに行く。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/Uf70pwjFfkIfKhsRvDf39RvLnkQPtZCs.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是真理社的副社长，各务千寻。要是我们真理社的孩子捅了篓子，请马上通知我。","text_original":"ヴェリタスの副部長、各務チヒロ。 もしうちの子たちが問題を起こしたら、すぐに私に知らせて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/GQ2GbIdo5LBHetnDMl6Qq7KPHX9LOGt5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"嗯，果然学无止境。","text_original":"うん。やっぱり、学びに限界は存在しないものだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/zdMeJmiwwVtQRMVuOzPiGtaZPehAaGey.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"老师教的知识，总是很新鲜。","text_original":"先生がくれる知識は、いつも目新しいものばかりだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/4tyad0ijwVsz11wJTivJegqn1fOHhl3C.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师，我的理解更深入了。","text_original":"ありがとう先生。また少し、賢くなれた。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/ec1x18qo5qSXvJwyt3cEVX72Tl05o3QU.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"哦，这些数据挺有用嘛。","text_original":"へぇー、いいデータだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/YnNdw2kVy4gk9ctLHVQQRCuIbSMcA8n0.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"知识应该是自由的……这是一句美好却很沉重的宣言。","text_original":"知識は自由であるべき……。良い言葉だけど、重みのある言葉だよね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/6xD1VrG1TKf04CcmtPgYlSZCN41PPamK.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"真理社不止是怪咖们的乐园。 还要避免被研讨会垄断信息……这个组织就是为此而成立的。","text_original":"ヴェリタスは、ただの変わり者たちの遊び場じゃない。 セミナーとかに情報を独占されないように…… それを目的にして設立された組織なんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/ClcuTo5Q3lBTAh9rX1tDzHYiJIkgQ48G.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然不可否认，因为这个而聚集在一起的社员们大多都是些怪咖……","text_original":"まあ、その結果集まったメンバーが変わり者ばっかりなのは、 否定しないけど……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/UFvhROEYsbEk8uoBsxAF3lcT7gZYYnb8.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"如果可以的话，请不要在我面前把真理社叫做“情报爬虫”。","text_original":"できれば、私の前でヴェリタスのことを「トラッカーズ」って呼ぶのは、やめてほしい……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/OeHYpaNXVop5QLGffRtrGwsAUPND1eQV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"日鞠社长的想法连我都猜不透。","text_original":"ヒマリの考えてることは、私にも全部は分からないよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/wFvmgDXfmj4je6a1sJ2kY1fwSVeI6cB1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"沙勒好像有些人在反复尝试入侵，想要获取老师的信息。","text_original":"先生の情報を手に入れようと、 色々とハッキングしてくる生徒たちがいるみたいだね……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/mqmpmQpou9O93KNrSz0z94ztrt78Xrtq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"有两个……不，是三个？或许还有更多……","text_original":"二人……いや、三人？もしかしたらもっといるかも……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/Kh1ziygneOBVDR0Wj9RM2gFWV9nTbIAS.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"你好啊，老师。看来今天也很忙啊。","text_original":"おはよ、先生。今日も忙しそうだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/to9nusxdzYgQ4FwcSJ7jymMY70ePtFUI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_LogIn_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，我不是告诉过你外出之前一定要锁屏吗？","text_original":"先生、離席する時はスクリーンセーバーを忘れないように。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/qXmMgKZEcEWZZxs1AssXwXrwU90MtbN4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_LogIn_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"万一有人不怀好意，调取老师的个人信息该怎么办？","text_original":"誰かが悪意をもって、先生の個人情報を奪おうとしたらどうするの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/GvacxCyVNkE4CQXaQRzWHqknUikZgnQr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_MemorialLobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，哎……工作结束后来罐咖啡，味道就是不一样。","text_original":"ふふっ、やっぱりひと仕事終えた後のコーヒーは格別だね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/lyCqmQoVdunZ65Df32adPethXdthmtlY.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯? 你以为要去咖啡厅吗？","text_original":"……ん？カフェとかだと思った？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/qTD5tiFkddQZ4PZQ1OxEWFz9OcxVRTyb.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"抱歉啊。这个时间咖啡店都打烊了，只有这里能喝到咖啡了。","text_original":"ごめんね。こんな時間だからもうどこもやってないし、 ここぐらいしか飲めるところが無くってさ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/StfWEYjHzXq2lNBj7FaucxahjD1fri1w.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我……需要通宵的时候总是会来这里喝咖啡。","text_original":"私、いつも徹夜明けはここで、コーヒーを飲むことにしてて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/c8PL5gt9HKMwDJaqk1sHFaRK14nGFkki.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"这台自动售货机就算在这个时间，就算没人看着，也还是安安静静地，干着自己的活,是吧？","text_original":"この自販機はこんな時間でも、誰にも見られてなくても、 淡々ときちんと自分の役目を果たしてる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/m6RWa2xfK1YadfLLJBDcJDtZGXfEdMce.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"不知道为什么总感觉和我的工作有点像……","text_original":"何だかそういうところが、自分の役目に重なってるような気がして……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/DeghaZmIr6j6bMOTRBeTyh7HtxtArgYa.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_MemorialLobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"如果老师也能品出这罐咖啡的独特滋味，我会很开心的。","text_original":"……先生も、このコーヒーの味が分かってくれたら、嬉しいな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/BBLOqfnWzA0VNvJoACOX8zIV7fW4FpgV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"我不想黑进老师的思维里，你有什么想法就都告诉我吧。","text_original":"先生に対してハッキングとかはしたくないから…思ってることを、素直に教えてほしい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/kYLoFoEcPKBmepfk2PQcgcAsQqgPxisG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"我会一直，在这里支持老师的。","text_original":"わたしは、いつもここから先生のことを支援しているから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/wQ27WO20cTZyyjzZKp2DwoyHUvF48UBZ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师实在是让人放心不下，可不能留下不管。我指的是，安全方面。","text_original":" 先生みたいの甘ちょろいのはどうにも放っておけなくて。あくまでセキュリティの話。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/nlV0oRAfkYNNfG29mg8jgJNUUhr77pJS.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"老师，今天深夜……我可以过去做安全维护吗？","text_original":" 先生。その…今夜、深夜のセキュリティチェックに行ってもいい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/AVVyxOG9BEpj7rR80vYNAgbgZGy3YczV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Season_Birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"……我的生日？啊，原来今天是我的生日啊。","text_original":"……え？あっ……今日、私の誕生日か。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/4RFweRXN3wdtOUpAGMsMkemj0h27Q81m.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"平时尽忙着关注别人的信息……反而错过了自己的事情，有点不好意思呢。","text_original":"どうも普段から、誰かの情報を気にしてばっかりでね…… 自分の情報が抜けてたのはちょっと恥ずかしいな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/ZiVJwjM35B476KeMPAU99GYV3LqtHPdj.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐。无论是今天还是明天，祝老师的生活一直这么幸福。","text_original":"誕生日おめでとう、先生。 今日も明日も、先生の幸せな日常が守られますように。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/EvI9H4FfOmOW4VDYCCeZfmXwdV2FIaPS.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"虽然我不喜欢在万圣节涂鸦…… 不过就算放着不动，真纪也会过来画的。","text_original":"ハロウィンだからって、別に自分でペイントとかはしないけど…… まあ、放っておいてもマキが勝手に描きに来るから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/sXGxAahArOFu8hXuauUgvWYOxSdYN19b.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"……呵呵，很可爱吧？","text_original":"……ふふっ、可愛いよね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/W1FWNTop9uC6IluUvgqZhE25h6lJqYCh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新年快乐。趁着新年，一起整理一下积压的数据怎么样？","text_original":"明けましておめでとう、先生。 新年を迎えたことだし、溜まったデータの整理でも一緒にどう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/9DWpaSSDgEINI2znCM7avXAN3QUXIV7X.ogg"},{"description":"CH0160_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"平安夜的咖啡厅很安静，非常适合熬夜工作。","text_original":"クリスマスイブのカフェはのんびりしてて、徹夜作業にピッタリ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/9nvzafQGrAx1zEPE8MLuS06edPewI4Rf.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0160_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"嗯，我全都看见了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/GPA72begEWDac0BA1TJdakbnDpvfgRTN.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"砰~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/HyU1pcXNZsxEWtkEysDQCPlVz6sSehHj.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"枪械对白帽黑客来说也是必不可少的。比如说，嗯……用来对付蛮不讲理的客户……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/MQhVfIvDYPRmboB3UdluAYQvUgPZUbrg.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"嗯？是发现新的安全漏洞了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/UoJjPBw8G4dBAFi4OYgeZ3fxPswGI7VX.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"知道了，我马上到。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/K1g6dRKe51n4gdVrF9HgeTgbMbgYr09K.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是真理社的副社长，各务千寻。要是我们真理社的孩子捅了篓子，请马上通知我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/KdK1pOKFzipSun69W3fqPL79eWbFr8QM.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"嗯，果然学无止境。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/cOVWQTjb0axr5j4sBqmpzMpYYBR9yWWJ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"老师教的知识，总是很新鲜。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/6eqEbNB1vEDiVs1PCOnEnuY2k5z3vqhs.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师，我的理解更深入了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/9cj80N9vE4M7mzfkoy2GGJw9HQcCYULd.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"哦，这些数据挺有用嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/okB2uAmY0pmkql9xmq1aEzvKH6WgMgtS.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"知识应该是自由的……这是一句美好却很沉重的宣言。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/wnlRhCySzat5qMCMEeSLBy9KIzuc9ghK.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"真理社不止是怪咖们的乐园。 还要避免被研讨会垄断信息……这个组织就是为此而成立的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/IDakU8whI0rm7nUtiJVzix86YIhRJzt5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽然不可否认，因为这个而聚集在一起的社员们大多都是些怪咖……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/opSq8PsQmYhKRx4pO0eKI02dt0Xo1oNm.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"如果可以的话，请不要在我面前把真理社叫做“情报爬虫”。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/lE1km9fDiziCVezaVFaKEkONf1Wyd4Z0.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"日鞠社长的想法连我都猜不透。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/h5drkAeTW5MNiA3ePFQbHxnPHMyjSisV.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"沙勒好像有些人在反复尝试入侵，想要获取老师的信息。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/gVxHheN9i9aiOMB4Tcns0gkxVRAAfGqr.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"有两个……不，是三个？或许还有更多……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/zkE1gPSrEwic6kC7OIRPWeQ7pdDb43PB.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"你好啊，老师。看来今天也很忙啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/fHkMdZVOY7UoGTZsHfYyeKq8WkviglLH.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_login_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，我不是告诉过你外出之前一定要锁屏吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/OlL65ii86CvoEgJptWtlnet8zjZk4kVj.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_login_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"万一有人不怀好意，调取老师的个人信息该怎么办？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/0amfFrTBgMke7iOgTpu1GZoRMELjccEA.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，哎……工作结束后来罐咖啡，味道就是不一样。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/0EkvMKv9cxKfH5L9oQaOmzoPhMRy42E1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯? 你以为要去咖啡厅吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/dZSVbGpRd3h9xiHpAJxcr0DYBpy7eaRE.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"抱歉啊。这个时间咖啡店都打烊了，只有这里能喝到咖啡了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/dl14U1EmQxnLkESnR8R6ipo3g8MHzKWH.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我……需要通宵的时候总是会来这里喝咖啡。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/ZXHKqih6wqE0Oc9YmA9CBdraBKiDe9Lr.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"这台自动售货机就算在这个时间，就算没人看着，也还是安安静静地，干着自己的活,是吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/KsB5ljIJyrhGKGSx7ZwAN1bU8UFKpDAA.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"不知道为什么总感觉和我的工作有点像……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/wPajU8D9CMDAcyDhMYC3hsZrmD1OpiqO.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"如果老师也能品出这罐咖啡的独特滋味，我会很开心的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/sVUNWZccmKbogf953UV2HdJ6ZowQXJun.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"我不想黑进老师的思维里，你有什么想法就都告诉我吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/cHgkQFqhhe3F0GhX3aoW4MOn79VGcfXc.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"我会一直，在这里支持老师的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/edacwMESvFbW9qs40UsimkBz9cMndlLu.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师实在是让人放心不下，可不能留下不管。我指的是，安全方面。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/iqVt6xrBj7z2lbgU733K4ic3SZgposk3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"老师，今天深夜……我可以过去做安全维护吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/ujxmiXnCmsO2wNE2I4qIAYYC3iwghlxn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"……我的生日？啊，原来今天是我的生日啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/4hhrozMtKNawAfHaJMQnOd0GxilxUb9Z.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"平时尽忙着关注别人的信息……反而错过了自己的事情，有点不好意思呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/vgERvAhAAtuE9yPWpVhkTOfVvC9iRiEb.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐。无论是今天还是明天，祝老师的生活一直这么幸福。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/PFeUhflRezka9qrGDTidpyM5jbjvldYe.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春快乐。今天就暂时丢下那些积压的数据，和我一起放松一下吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/utK0XgUdPjTmZBl83akQZ3681aZWT4hW.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"虽然我不喜欢在万圣节涂鸦…… 不过就算放着不动，真纪也会过来画的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/sf1UHYB0fsfkzHEBILgzhM97YUtjQQnO.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"……呵呵，很可爱吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/3NkoJrZF8lMwU478fb1z3PfTJ4u4pdGq.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"中秋节啊，我给真理社的社员们发了月饼。不过，这里还有些剩下的，老师要一起分享吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/DzJSqlNh1uXf0Swv1qKtuM76gW0NFwLe.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新年快乐。趁着新年，一起整理一下积压的数据怎么样？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/pJA8QXEI7IGy6F0igz5BOG1wFJVchYpL.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"平安夜的咖啡厅很安静，非常适合熬夜工作。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/WEotyahDRqeEDyIBh0N8JjRFX8cb2kL0.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/EjhlWqXAHatAXclE3PkT6zVEviRm0Vnp.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这……看来又是我们真理社的孩子捅出的篓子。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/6c8z2ULt6PAxxTTC0WfcXjG4wcyLegiJ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"嗯……嗯，熬了一夜，确实有点累了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/5Ntyhalhh1twvYuGh3CzMpxgRw4KzbHv.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"咦……难道，服务器又崩溃了……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/DViKJucB6tOlHGfSZFNBy4sYvMIXZwEz.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"（这家咖啡厅不卖咖啡吗？）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/KouIxHRssiBMvXyNvZXDMHr1c2vAcIHf.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（这种程度的安保防护……10秒就足够了。）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/LAAbxMAAMRFd0UuuSotzeVItLZj5H4qI.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"我会修复安全漏洞的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/nTpcTMHaGjGYUpwgjtBz1M1kbmliywh8.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"其实我不太喜欢这种破解方法。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/fJTllKfJdzBu690mc1xVfMcjpaDbX4Ha.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"不过为了可爱的后辈们，没办法了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/vq4SaY2XAIOef98tVOvZA9G7ZciYOXa8.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"哼，下不为例啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/0VRGDHHuau5ytsdw0PZLOUajQlN8vEOU.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"你最好提高一下安全意识。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/1vSxSU5dx5OYZHFuDTBoProRR5mQbtoK.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0160_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%84%E5%8A%A1%20%E5%8D%83%E5%AF%BB/original/ch0160_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0160_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%90%